                <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>

            <div class="money-market-benefit-copy">
              <h4>Capital preservation of funds</h4>

              <p>
                Focused on protecting your capital through prudent investment strategies.
              </p>
            </div>

          </article>

          <article class="money-market-benefit">

            <span
              class="money-market-benefit-icon"
              aria-hidden="true"
